OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan with MND organises sea dip to
OL,4,Araise awareness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired orthodontist who was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with motor neurone disease
OL,8,F(MND) just over a year ago is
OL,9,Forganising a fancy dress dip on
OL,10,FBrighton beach on Friday.
OL,12,FJon (Joff) Machell, who was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith MND in October last year, has
OL,14,Forganised the dip during the British
OL,15,FOrthodontic Conference in the city.
OL,17,FThe 56-year-old, who is from Exeter in
OL,18,FDevon, wants friends and colleagues to
OL,19,Fgather in outrageous fancy dress and
OL,20,Fform a giant circle in the shallows,
OL,21,Fperforming a Mexican wave to raise
OL,22,Fawareness of MND.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
